SUMMARY:New Year\, New Bot - Build Its AI Brain with .NET and Aspire
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nBuild the bot's AI brain with a .NE
 T backend orchestrated through .NET Aspire.\n\nConnect the backend to the 
 StackChan from Episode 1\, add the services and observability needed for l
 ocal development\, and create an end-to-end interaction that makes the phy
 sical desk robot responsive.\n\nThis session shows how Aspire helps develo
 pers build and run the pieces of a connected AI companion.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/microsoft-reactor-toronto/events/3171
 64434/
