SUMMARY:.NET + Foundry\, better together
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nWhat can you build with .NET and Mi
 crosoft Foundry? Let’s find out together! Join us for a series of practi
 cal explorations featuring new SDK capabilities\, cool projects\, and the 
 latest Foundry features and services. With live demos\, code\, and plenty 
 of curiosity\, each episode offers something new for .NET developers looki
 ng to learn\, experiment\, and build with AI.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/microsoft-reactor-toronto/events/3166
 96257/
