SUMMARY:From Insight to Action: Build a Real Workplace App
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nLet’s start with a problem people
  actually have at work and build something useful around it. We’ll go fr
 om data and insight to a working Fabric App\, showing the decisions\, trad
 eoffs\, and lessons along the way.\n\n📌 This event is part of a series.
  Learn more here:\nhttps://aka.ms/DataDays/FabConRecap/y\nhttps://aka.ms/D
 ataDays/IntoCerts/y\nhttps://aka.ms/AIatWork/UnderstandIt/y\nhttps://aka.m
 s/AIatWork/BuildIt/y\nhttps://aka.ms/AIatWork/ShowIt/y\n\n[eventID:27723]
